  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling Up Nutrition Phase II (SUN Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;SUN Phase II delivers a package of high-impact interventions to the 1,000 days households, offering counselling on infant and young child feeding practices and maternal and adolescent nutrition, promoting referral to health facilities for key nutrition-specific interventions delivered through the health facility, guiding on nutrition-sensitive agriculture for dietary diversification, and promoting safe water, sanitation and hygiene.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
